{"schemaVersion":1,"id":38,"sections":[{"id":"115001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1270],"start":0,"count":10},{"id":"115001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11260],"start":10,"count":12},{"id":"115002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1280],"start":22,"count":13},{"id":"115002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11270],"start":35,"count":8},{"id":"115003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1290],"start":43,"count":10},{"id":"115003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11280],"start":53,"count":30}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:2","scriptId":1270,"text":"马奇诺研究所化为一堆废墟，留在这里也不会有新的收获，所以只能返航了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:3","scriptId":1270,"text":"由于索菲亚教官把吉普车当掩体，导致吉普车完全报废……于是只能找就近的军事基地看看有没有代步工具。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:4","scriptId":1270,"text":"“从地图上看，离最近的大型中继站还有十公里的路程。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:5","scriptId":1270,"text":"“好远……走过去要好几个小时……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:6","scriptId":1270,"text":"“安啦，区区十公里，你应该要庆幸还有命从那两个怪物手里逃出来。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:7","scriptId":1270,"text":"“也是……当时我以为必死无疑了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":108,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:8","scriptId":1270,"text":"“单单一个埃普西隆就已经弄得我们晕头转向了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":108,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:9","scriptId":1270,"text":"“这次和人形生物正面交锋的事情我一定要亲自传达给老爸。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:10","scriptId":1270,"text":"“恩……总之此事非同小可，特别是埃普西隆这种令人发指的战斗力……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-PROLOGUE:1270:11","scriptId":1270,"text":"“我这边也会提供一份关于不明物质的分析报告给胜利女神特勤局。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:1","scriptId":11260,"text":"返程途中——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:2","scriptId":11260,"text":"“我始终有一个想不通的问题……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:3","scriptId":11260,"text":"“什么问题？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:4","scriptId":11260,"text":"“马奇诺那么大的研究所竟然没有钢舞姬镇守？那么容易就让敌人直接得手，这怎么想都非常奇怪。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":36,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:5","scriptId":11260,"text":"“难道都……死了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":36,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":108,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:6","scriptId":11260,"text":"“有这个可能……尸体被吃了，于是就找不到了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":108,"right":36,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:7","scriptId":11260,"text":"“就我在研究大楼里看到的情况来说，倒是没看到钢舞姬的尸体，都是研究人员的……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":108,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:8","scriptId":11260,"text":"“而且从尸体的破损程度来说，战车兽只是单纯地弄死了目标，都没怎么吃。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":108,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:9","scriptId":11260,"text":"“难道和埃普西隆她们有什么关系？感觉战车兽都对她们唯命是从的样子。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:10","scriptId":11260,"text":"“恩，谜一样的敌人和战车兽的奇怪行为这两者之间一定有什么联系。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":0,"speaker":"？？？","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:11","scriptId":11260,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":0,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115001-EPILOGUE:11260:12","scriptId":11260,"text":"抱着心中的疑问，指挥官一行继续返程中……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":0,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:2","scriptId":1280,"text":"地点----？？？","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":0,"right":211,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:3","scriptId":1280,"text":"“奥米克戎队长，我们回来了”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:4","scriptId":1280,"text":"兰布达松开了拖着埃普西隆的手……","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":49,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:5","scriptId":1280,"text":"“疼疼疼……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":56,"right":49,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:6","scriptId":1280,"text":"“终于回来了？稍微有点慢啊，是不是埃普西隆又惹事了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":49,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":411,"speaker":"伊塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:7","scriptId":1280,"text":"“她又不是第一次了，肯定是这么回事。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":411,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:8","scriptId":1280,"text":"“哪有～只不过是稍微和钢舞姬们玩了下而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":50,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":411,"speaker":"伊塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:9","scriptId":1280,"text":"“我就说吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":411,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":420,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:10","scriptId":1280,"text":"“嗯！？钢舞姬？？不是说尽量避免接触吗！？怎么回事？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":420,"right":411,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:11","scriptId":1280,"text":"“正巧撞上了呗……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":420,"right":50,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":420,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:12","scriptId":1280,"text":"“你不知道这事情的严重性吗？亏我还特地调开了那个研究所的守备。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":420,"right":50,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:13","scriptId":1280,"text":"“好了好了……反正重要的试验数据已经拿到手，研究所也被我爆破掉了，不会有证据留下的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":420,"right":56,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115002-PROLOGUE:1280:15","scriptId":1280,"text":"“这还差不多。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115002-EPILOGUE:11270:1","scriptId":11270,"text":"继续向着最近的军事基地徒步行进，途中不乏一些零星的战车兽骚扰，不过有索菲亚教官在，它们只有被秒杀的份……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115002-EPILOGUE:11270:2","scriptId":11270,"text":"“报告，前面看到一个中继站！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":56,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115002-EPILOGUE:11270:3","scriptId":11270,"text":"莉娜从前方传来了好消息。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":56,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115002-EPILOGUE:11270:4","scriptId":11270,"text":"“太好了，终于有地方可以休息了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115002-EPILOGUE:11270:5","scriptId":11270,"text":"“不过那个中继站的周围好像正在进行战斗，有大量战车兽！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115002-EPILOGUE:11270:6","scriptId":11270,"text":"“……真倒霉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115002-EPILOGUE:11270:7","scriptId":11270,"text":"“嗯？你刚才说什么？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115002-EPILOGUE:11270:8","scriptId":11270,"text":"“啊……我是说快点前去支援！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":469,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:2","scriptId":1290,"text":"“可恶，怎么会有那么多战车兽！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":469,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":480,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:3","scriptId":1290,"text":"“我也不知道啊？？队长怎么办？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":469,"right":480,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":445,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:4","scriptId":1290,"text":"“呜呜呜……这下怎么办才好……在这里已经被围困了两天了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":480,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":445,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:5","scriptId":1290,"text":"“早知道就应该待在研究所里，那里更安全还能看小说……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":480,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":469,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:6","scriptId":1290,"text":"“那是上级的命令，队长也太窝囊了！都什么时候了还想着那些有的没的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":469,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":450,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:7","scriptId":1290,"text":"“雷思丽太认真了……偶尔偷懒一下也没关系的啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":450,"right":469,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":465,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:8","scriptId":1290,"text":"（我怎么会摊上一个这么废柴的队长……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":450,"right":465,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:9","scriptId":1290,"text":"“别吵了！看那边，3点钟方向有一队钢舞姬正在往我们这边赶！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":475,"right":465,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":462,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:10","scriptId":1290,"text":"“哦！援军吗！？终于来了啊！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":475,"right":462,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":442,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-PROLOGUE:1290:11","scriptId":1290,"text":"“这下终于得救了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":442,"right":462,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:1","scriptId":11280,"text":"与驻守部队里应外合，成功干掉了中继站周围的战车兽群。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":442,"right":462,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:2","scriptId":11280,"text":"“呼……你们没事吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":462,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":462,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:3","scriptId":11280,"text":"“啊，你好。谢谢你们即时赶到替我们解了围。我是雷思丽·戴维斯。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":462,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:4","scriptId":11280,"text":"“我是达克妮·戴维斯，你们真是神勇啊，那么多战车兽竟然能在那么短时间内就清理掉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":475,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:5","scriptId":11280,"text":"“哈哈！小事一桩！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":37,"right":475,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:6","scriptId":11280,"text":"“这可不是你一个人的功劳，笨蛋佐伊！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":37,"right":87,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:7","scriptId":11280,"text":"“我是猎虎小队的队长奈乐，这是伏龙芝的索菲亚教官。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":87,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:8","scriptId":11280,"text":"“干得不错嘛～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:9","scriptId":11280,"text":"“哇噢～好像来了大人物，队长你快出来！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":475,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:10","scriptId":11280,"text":"顺着达克妮所指的方向看过去，墙角边还躲这个钢舞姬，正朝这边张望……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":475,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:11","scriptId":11280,"text":"（呃……这是她们的队长？我还以为就达克妮和雷思丽她们两个呢……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":475,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":442,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:12","scriptId":11280,"text":"“你们好……我是利爪小队的队长，瓦什蒂·布雷德利……谢，谢谢你们……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":442,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:13","scriptId":11280,"text":"“那你们就是驻守这个中继站的钢舞姬？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":442,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":462,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:14","scriptId":11280,"text":"“正确的说并不是，我们是被派来这个中继站勘察的，所属是马奇诺研究所～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":462,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:15","scriptId":11280,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":462,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":108,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:16","scriptId":11280,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":108,"right":462,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":97,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:17","scriptId":11280,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":108,"right":97,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":36,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:18","scriptId":11280,"text":"“啊，怪不得研究所……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":36,"right":97,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":86,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:19","scriptId":11280,"text":"“笨蛋佐伊不要多嘴！这里交给长官他们。”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":36,"right":86,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":440,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:20","scriptId":11280,"text":"“恩？研究所发生了什么事情吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":440,"right":86,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:21","scriptId":11280,"text":"看到众人的反应，利爪小队的队员们都有点不解。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":440,"right":86,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:22","scriptId":11280,"text":"“唉……反正你们迟早要知道的……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":440,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:23","scriptId":11280,"text":"“我们就是从马奇诺研究所那边过来的，那边受到了战车兽攻击，现在已经成为了一堆废墟……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":440,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":469,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:24","scriptId":11280,"text":"“什么！！？？这怎么可能？？研究所不是有驱兽喷雾吗？而且应该还有其他驻守小队的成员啊？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":469,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:25","scriptId":11280,"text":"“从那边的情况看，至少驱兽喷雾没起到效果，研究人员都不幸遇难，但没有发现任何钢舞姬的迹象。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":469,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":445,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:26","scriptId":11280,"text":"“太奇怪了，应该至少有3支队伍在马奇诺研究所驻守。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:27","scriptId":11280,"text":"“看来此事有内有蹊跷……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":445,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:28","scriptId":11280,"text":"“能不能详细告诉我们一下那边发生的事情？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:29","scriptId":11280,"text":"“这个说来话长了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115003-EPILOGUE:11280:30","scriptId":11280,"text":"于是我们把研究所发生的事情一五一十的告诉了利爪小队。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["马奇诺研究所全毁……","另一边……","这个中继站正在受到战车兽的包围攻击。"]}
